title: "StanLogic: Boolean Minimization Through Geometric Clustering and Hierarchical Decomposition"
authors:
  - family-names: "Emeka-Onwunume"
    given-names: "Somtochukwu Stanislus"
    affiliation: "Stase Intelligence"
