url: "https://github.com/Stanislus29/stanlogic"
abstract: >-
  StanLogic is a Python library for Boolean function minimization and
  computational logic. It combines bitmask-based operations, geometric
  clustering, and hierarchical decomposition to investigate the simplification
  of Boolean systems. The project includes logic minimization utilities,
  prime implicant processing, Verilog generation, benchmarking, equivalence
  testing, and experimental analysis of Boolean hypercube structure and
  higher-dimensional minimization. It supports research in algorithm design,
  computational mathematics, digital logic, and logic synthesis.
keywords:
  - Boolean algebra
  - Boolean minimization
  - Karnaugh maps
  - Geometric clustering
  - Boolean hypercube
  - Hierarchical decomposition
  - Logic synthesis
